        observe: "After choosing, keep measuring what mattered in the decision: debugging time per incident, failed runs recovered by persistence, and upgrade effort per release.",
        security: "Frameworks run with your credentials and tools; review their dependency trees, tracing destinations, and default data collection before adoption.",
